# Plotwork provider

[Plotwork](https://plotwork.dev) draws diagrams from a small text language. This provider turns your
Terraform, or anything else Plotwork imports, into those diagrams, and keeps them current: because the
diagram is part of the configuration, every apply that changes the infrastructure changes the picture.
No separate CI job or agent is involved.

| Block | Does | Plan |
|---|---|---|
| `plotwork_import` | Turns files (Terraform, Kubernetes, Compose, SQL and more) into Plotwork source | Pro |
| `plotwork_render` | Renders source to an SVG you write anywhere: S3, Azure Storage, Google Cloud Storage, a file | Pro |
| `plotwork_diagram` | Publishes to your library or your organisation's, with an optional stable link | Every plan |

